{
  "name": "roleALPHA: Workflows follow the organisation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "7c3116ef-ebf3-5222-9fb1-7d6cc3e17426",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflows follow the organisation\nEvery 15 minutes the builder compares the roleALPHA graph with the snapshot table `rolealpha_snapshot` (columns: uuid, entity_type, name, custom_id, fingerprint, fields, edges, seen_at \u2014 all text).\n\nFor every new, changed or removed step, role or agent, the model proposes what that means for the n8n workflows. A usable proposal becomes an **inactive draft**, and every person filling the deciding role of the governing step gets an e-mail with links to approve or reject it (workflow *roleALPHA: Approve workflow drafts*).\n\nSet the values in **Settings** and the credentials (roleALPHA MCP OAuth2, n8n API, Anthropic, SMTP). The first run only stores the snapshot.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf96f6a1-24ac-5ffe-bff4-d2bb9586bbc8",
      "name": "Every 15 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c74beeb7-1723-56f3-b2e2-f9f50d47f8b7",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "55a07646-eb3b-5977-bc3a-6e2cc5e16995",
              "name": "endpointUrl",
              "value": "https://rolealpha.app/api/mcp",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "17309c31-3785-5c16-b53e-d9d3f138f25e",
              "name": "organisation",
              "value": "roleALPHA GmbH",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f86905f5-0e6f-5ef7-9d89-51834d18eb3e",
              "name": "governingStep",
              "value": "automation:workflow-changes",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0b16c2b8-5ae3-5d04-8b12-28796bb3a9fe",
              "name": "n8nUrl",
              "value": "https://n8n.example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "64cde423-336c-52b1-95f0-0e4f6048bf5f",
              "name": "approvalUrl",
              "value": "https://n8n.example.com/webhook/rolealpha-workflow-approval",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0d356e94-1970-565d-a5ef-92a40e514514",
              "name": "mailFrom",
              "value": "n8n@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "75383fdb-0e1b-5d65-8f5b-07db6c340c27",
      "name": "Read snapshot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "rolealpha_snapshot"
        },
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "id": "b5da7e1e-bc12-56f5-858c-75e8f9748996",
      "name": "Detect changes",
      "type": "@rolealpha/n8n-nodes-rolealpha.roleAlphaWorkflowBuilder",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "detectChanges",
        "endpointUrl": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.endpointUrl }}",
        "organisation": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.organisation }}",
        "entityTypes": [
          "process",
          "role",
          "agent"
        ],
        "snapshotRows": "={{ $('Read snapshot').all().map((i) => i.json) }}",
        "detectOptions": {}
      },
      "executeOnce": true,
      "credentials": {
        "mcpOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "roleALPHA MCP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "76a58d8c-5a80-5b65-8c3d-a3fdfbb873b6",
      "name": "Rows to store",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "upsert",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f108940-6e6f-5779-b162-704b7bf5c993",
      "name": "Store row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "rolealpha_snapshot"
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "uuid",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.uuid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": null
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "895fbbca-7dd7-5f5e-b128-eacc8ab6a503",
      "name": "Rows to remove",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "remove",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e0ac7c93-b860-5cac-bdfa-8283aa07cbb7",
      "name": "Remove row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "deleteRows",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "rolealpha_snapshot"
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "uuid",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $json.remove }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4bd71dcc-1046-5317-8921-0fb352f14bc8",
      "name": "Changes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "changes",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "919fcce8-887e-59e8-95f4-0b550ae647fb",
      "name": "Propose",
      "type": "@rolealpha/n8n-nodes-rolealpha.roleAlphaWorkflowBuilder",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "propose",
        "endpointUrl": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.endpointUrl }}",
        "organisation": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.organisation }}",
        "change": "={{ $json }}",
        "extraRules": "Systems: Directus (collections are named in the domains of the roles).\nThe generic runner is the workflow \"roleALPHA: Runner\"; start it with Execute Workflow and pass agentUuid, step and trigger.",
        "maxAttempts": 2
      },
      "credentials": {
        "mcpOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "roleALPHA MCP"
        },
        "n8nApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "n8n API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6092e34e-dd97-5595-b9bc-2f8e01fe8556",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        1120,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "claude-opus-5-5"
        },
        "options": {
          "maxTokensToSample": 16000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Anthropic"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1f48a38-75f5-5be0-a160-1bc6f73589e0",
      "name": "Usable proposal?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        1340,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "56978cfb-d78a-50c2-92e4-b5dc1a9f42c0",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "683443a7-e5f8-543b-b844-83dbbaccaafb",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
              "rightValue": "none",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0db21a50-5917-53d8-b45f-c00ed605b9b7",
      "name": "Create draft",
      "type": "@rolealpha/n8n-nodes-rolealpha.roleAlphaWorkflowBuilder",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "createDraft",
        "proposal": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "n8nApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "n8n API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "30eb7020-a877-50d4-8ec1-8ddf1d3bd0b6",
      "name": "Who decides",
      "type": "@rolealpha/n8n-nodes-rolealpha.roleAlpha",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1780,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "responsibility",
        "operation": "getDecider",
        "endpointUrl": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.endpointUrl }}",
        "organisation": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.organisation }}",
        "step": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.governingStep }}",
        "responsibilityOptions": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "mcpOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "roleALPHA MCP"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa892d1a-0ed8-5144-bed0-5db0c98d744f",
      "name": "Deciding roles",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2000,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "roles",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e767080e-069b-54e6-8be8-12d3270c7a8f",
      "name": "Persons",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2220,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "holders.persons",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cf563ccb-3559-5c00-ad9a-b9a048aaea27",
      "name": "Ask for approval",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2440,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.mailFrom }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Workflow change to approve: {{ $('Create draft').item.json.draftName }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>{{ $('Create draft').item.json.entityName }} was {{ $('Create draft').item.json.change }} in roleALPHA. The model proposes to <b>{{ $('Create draft').item.json.action }}</b> a workflow:</p><blockquote>{{ $('Create draft').item.json.reason }}</blockquote>{{ $('Create draft').item.json.notes.length ? '<p>Before approving: ' + $('Create draft').item.json.notes.join('; ') + '</p>' : '' }}<p><a href=\"{{ $('Settings').first().json.n8nUrl }}/workflow/{{ $('Create draft').item.json.draftId }}\">Look at the draft</a></p><p><a href=\"{{ $('Settings').first().json.approvalUrl }}?draftId={{ $('Create draft').item.json.draftId }}&hash={{ $('Create draft').item.json.contentHash }}&decision=approve\">Approve</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"{{ $('Settings').first().json.approvalUrl }}?draftId={{ $('Create draft').item.json.draftId }}&decision=reject\">Reject</a></p><p>You get this because you fill {{ $('Deciding roles').item.json.name }}.</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "SMTP"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
